Mark nearby rock cells that would fail if triggered (FS ≤ 1) (red @= joint sliding, orange @= deviatoric, purple @= overhang / cut off by joints, yellow @= key block). on/off: live mode (updates automatically as you move and the terrain changes)=標出周圍若被觸發就會破壞（FS ≤ 1）的岩格（紅 @= 節理滑動、橙 @= 軸差、紫 @= 懸臂／被節理切離、黃 @= 關鍵塊體）。on/off：即時模式（跟著玩家與地形變化自動更新）
