Only excavation-induced deterioration causes failure (generated terrain is treated as in equilibrium)=只有開挖造成的惡化才破壞（生成的地形視為已平衡）
Excavation-induced failure only=只算開挖造成的破壞
Compares before and after excavation: fails only if FS > 1 before and FS ≤ 1 after (pre-existing instability only falls once completely unsupported)=比較開挖前後：只有開挖前 FS > 1、開挖後 FS ≤ 1 才破壞（既有的不穩定要到完全懸空才掉）
Off: nearby rock that already has FS ≤ 1 fails as soon as it is triggered=關閉：附近原本就 FS ≤ 1 的岩體，一被觸發就會破壞
Joint plane sliding  τ ≥ cj + σn·tan φj=節理弱面滑動  τ ≥ cj + σn·tan φj
Joint plane sliding=節理弱面滑動
cj @1 MPa, φj @2° (same for all three sets); @3=cj @1 MPa，φj @2°（三組相同）；@3
must dip toward the free face (lateral limit ±@1°)=需傾向臨空面（側向限制 ±@1°）
no kinematic check=不檢查運動學
Off: joints do not affect strength (deviatoric failure only)=關閉：節理不影響強度（只有軸差破壞）
TNT blast fragmentation (by rock strength)=TNT 爆破破碎（依岩石強度）
Blast fragmentation=爆破破碎
Fragmentation radius @= blast radius × (@1/UCS)^@2; inner @3% ejected=破碎半徑 @= 爆炸半徑 × (@1/UCS)^@2；內 @3% 炸飛
Off: rock is unaffected by TNT (only other blocks are blown away)=關閉：岩石不受 TNT 影響（只炸掉其他方塊）
Cantilever / roof fracture (by tensile strength and thickness)=懸臂／頂板斷裂（依張力強度與厚度）
Cantilever fracture=懸臂斷裂
L_max @= √(σt,m·t/(3γ)), σt,m from GSI and N; @1=L_max @= √(σt,m·t/(3γ))，σt,m 依 GSI 與 N；@1
root sections cut by joints carry no tension=節理切過的根部斷面不傳張力
joints not considered=不考慮節理
Off: overhanging rock attached to the rock mass never breaks from being too long=關閉：連著岩體的懸空岩石不會因為伸太長而斷
Intact rock may turn into rubble when it falls=完整岩石掉落時有機率變成碎石
Breakage on falling=掉落破碎
Probability p @= 1 − exp(−fall height / h_ref), h_ref depends on lithology=機率 p @= 1 − exp(−落下高度 / h_ref)，h_ref 依岩性
Off: intact rock stays intact after falling=關閉：完整岩石掉落後仍是完整岩石
Rubble granular flow (8 levels per cell, spreads into slopes at the angle of repose; intact rock unaffected)=碎石顆粒流（每格分 8 級，依安息角攤成斜坡；完整岩石不受影響）
Rubble granular flow=碎石顆粒流
Angle of repose @1°; unsupported rubble still falls vertically=安息角 @1°；碎石懸空時仍會垂直落下
Off: rubble does not move even beyond the angle of repose=關閉：碎石超過安息角也不移動
Show key blocks that slide out as tumbling rockfall=關鍵塊體滑出時以翻滾落石呈現
Tumbling rockfall=翻滾落石
@1 currently tumbling, limit @2=目前翻滾中 @1 顆，上限 @2
Off: key blocks that slide out turn into rubble in place, then flow at the angle of repose=關閉：滑出的關鍵塊體原地變成碎石，再依安息角流動
No such toggle: @1=沒有這個開關: @1
You need the @1 privilege to change this=需要 @1 權限才能切換
@1: on=@1：開啟
@1: off=@1：關閉
In-game toggle (switches if on/off is omitted)=遊戲中開關（不加 on/off 則切換）
Usage: /rockmech_toggle <@1> [on|off]=用法：/rockmech_toggle <@1> [on|off]
State must be on or off=狀態只能是 on 或 off
Rock mechanics toggles (take effect immediately)=岩石力學開關（即時生效）
(You need the @1 privilege to change these)=（需要 @1 權限才能修改）
Mark rock cells with FS ≤ 1 around you (personal display)=標出周圍 FS ≤ 1 的岩格（個人顯示）
Warning cracks: 1 < FS < @1 after being affected (personal display)=警戒裂紋：受影響後 1 < FS < @1（個人顯示）
Full info page (/rockmech)=完整資訊頁（/rockmech）
Texture orientation test block (/rockmech_orient)=材質方向測試方塊（/rockmech_orient）
Place texture orientation test blocks in front of you (an F on each of the 6 faces, colors tell the faces apart)=在前方放材質方向測試方塊（6 面各一個 F，顏色區分哪一面）
[rockmech] Placed two test blocks to the east (one at eye level, one above so you can see its bottom face).=[rockmech] 已在東邊放兩個測試方塊（一個眼睛高度、一個在上方可看底面）。
Colors: top@=white bottom@=dark gray east@=red west@=green north@=blue south@=yellow=顏色：上@=白 下@=深灰 東@=紅 西@=綠 北@=藍 南@=黃
My assumption (tell me which face doesn't match):=我的假設（請告訴我哪一面不符合）：
・Red, green, blue, yellow (the four sides): seen from outside, a normal 'F' (upright, not mirrored)=・紅、綠、藍、黃（四個側面）：從外面看是正常的「F」（直立、不左右顛倒）
・White (top face): looking down while facing north, a normal 'F' (top of the F points north)=・白（頂面）：面向北方往下看時，是正常的「F」（F 的頂端朝北）
・Dark gray (bottom face): standing below, facing north and looking up, a normal 'F'=・深灰（底面）：站在下方、面向北方抬頭往上看時，是正常的「F」
(The HUD at the top right shows your heading)=（右上角 HUD 有方位顯示）

