Depth (m)=深度 (m)
Back=返回
Field notebook: Schmidt hammer readings (@1)=野帳本：施密特錘讀數（@1 筆）
No readings yet: right-click a rock face with the Schmidt hammer=還沒有讀數：拿施密特錘對岩面右鍵
Take about 10 readings at the same spot, sort them and take the median R. Uniaxial compressive strength (Katz 2000): UCS ≈ 2.21·e^(0.067R) MPa.=同一處敲 10 次左右，排序後取中位數 R。單軸抗壓強度（Katz 2000）：UCS ≈ 2.21·e^(0.067R) MPa。
Field notebook (@1 / @2 holes)=野帳本（@1 / @2 孔）
No holes logged yet: hold the field notebook and right-click a core box to log it=還沒記任何孔：拿著野帳本對岩芯箱按右鍵判讀
Schmidt hammer readings (@1)=施密特錘讀數（@1 筆）
Point load tests (@1)=點荷重試驗（@1）
Hand-held core drill@nRight-click the ground to drill down=手持岩芯鑽機@n對地面右鍵往下鑽
Pickaxe@nDigs rock slowly; rock turns into rubble@nDigging rubble picks it up, one block at a time@nRight-click to put down the rubble you are holding=挖礦鎬@n挖岩石很慢，岩石會變成碎石@n挖碎石就是拿起來，一次一塊@n右鍵放下手上的碎石
Shovel@nQuickly shovels up rubble, one block at a time@nCannot dig rock@nRight-click to put down the rubble you are holding=鏟子@n很快把碎石鏟起來，一次一塊@n挖不動岩石@n右鍵放下手上的碎石
Conveyor belt@nRight-click to place: click a belt to extend from that block, click the ground to start from the ground@nLeft-click a belt to pick up that block; left-click elsewhere to change the slope=輸送帶@n右鍵放：點輸送帶從那格往前接，點地面從地上開始@n左鍵點輸送帶收回那一格，點別的地方切換坡度
Field notebook@nRight-click a core box to log it (@1 s per metre, stay nearby) into a borehole log@nLeft-click to see logged holes (up to @2 holes)@nWhat you record depends on your skills at logging time: fields you cannot interpret are recorded as ?=野帳本@n右鍵對岩芯箱判讀（每公尺 @1 秒，要待在旁邊），記成柱狀圖@n左鍵看記過的孔（最多 @2 孔）@n記下來的照你判讀時的能力：不會的欄位記成 ?
Hand-held core drill@nRight-click the ground: drill a vertical hole and take core (@1 s per metre, max @2 m; deeper holes need the core drill rig); don't walk away while drilling@nThe core goes into a blue core box next to the collar; log it with a field notebook into a borehole log (lithology, grade, joints, RQD)=手持岩芯鑽機@n對著地面右鍵：往下鑽一個垂直孔取岩芯（每公尺 @1 秒、最深 @2 m，更深要用岩芯鑽探車），鑽的時候不能走開@n岩芯裝在藍色岩芯箱裡放在孔口旁邊，拿野帳本判讀成柱狀圖（岩性、品位、節理、RQD）
Hopper lining@nReinforced concrete holding back the hopper wall rock (so it is not cut loose by joints and does not fall)=受料倉混凝土護坡@n鋼筋混凝土，擋住倉壁的岩石（不會被節理切開掉落）
Crusher@nRight-click on flat ground to place; digs a @1×@2 m receiving hopper toward you@nRubble dumped into the hopper is weighed and paid for; waste rock costs a processing fee=破碎站@n對著平地按右鍵放置，朝自己的方向挖 @1×@2 m 受料倉@n碎石倒進倉裡就過磅入帳；廢石要賠處理費
Large crusher@nCapacity @1 t/s (regular crusher @2 t/s)@nRight-click on flat ground to place; digs a @3×@4 m receiving hopper toward you=大型破碎站@n處理能力 @1 t/s（一般破碎站 @2 t/s）@n對著平地按右鍵放置，朝自己的方向挖 @3×@4 m 受料倉
Rock drill@nHold left-click on a rock face to drill a hole (@1 s, @2 m); keep holding on a hole to deepen it 1 m every @3 s (max @4 m)=鑿岩機@n對岩面按住左鍵鑽孔（@1 秒、@2 m）；對鑽孔繼續按住每 @3 秒加深 1 m（最深 @4 m）
Emulsion explosive@nRight-click a drill hole to load it (max @1 per hole); without a hole it can only be stuck on the surface, with little power=乳膠炸藥@n對鑽孔按右鍵裝藥（一孔最多 @1 條）；沒有鑽孔只能貼面，威力很小
ANFO (ammonium nitrate/fuel oil, one bag)@nRight-click a downward drill hole to pour it in as a column charge; needs one emulsion cartridge as a primer=ANFO（銨油炸藥，一袋）@n對往下的鑽孔按右鍵倒進去成柱狀裝藥；要有一條乳膠炸藥當起爆藥包
Blasting machine@nRight-click: charges within @1 m count down @2 seconds, then fire in sequence=起爆器@n按右鍵：@1 m 內的裝藥倒數 @2 秒後依序起爆
Drone remote@nRight-click to take off (first person); WASD to move, E to speed up, Space to climb, Shift to descend@nRight-click again to return to the take-off point; height limit: @1 m above the take-off point=無人機遙控器@n右鍵起飛（第一人稱）；WASD 移動、E 加速、空白鍵上升、Shift 下降@n再按右鍵回到起飛點；高度上限：起飛點上方 @1 m
Command drone (drone + radio)@nRight-click to take off, right-click again to return to the take-off point; WASD to move, E to speed up, Space to climb, Shift to descend@nLeft-click (on the ground or in the air): click an excavator to select it, click the ground to send it there; click a dump truck or haul truck to open its AHS settings@nCommand range @1 m=指揮無人機（無人機＋對講機）@n右鍵起飛、再按右鍵回到起飛點；WASD 移動、E 加速、空白鍵上升、Shift 下降@n左鍵（地上、空中都可以）：點怪手選定、點地面叫它開過去；點卡車、礦卡打開無人駕駛設定@n指揮距離 @1 m
Rock bolt@nRight-click a drill hole to install it (length @= hole depth; anchorage capacity @= bond strength @1 kN/m × length, max @2 kN)=岩栓@n對鑽孔按右鍵裝進去（長度 @= 孔深；錨定力 @= 握裹力 @1 kN/m × 長度，上限 @2 kN）
Shotcrete (one bag)@nRight-click a rock face to spray a 3×3 area of that face (support pressure @1 MPa)@nSpray again to thicken it, up to @2 layers; the pressure adds up per layer@nRight-click rubble: compacts the top 3×3 surface directly (no flow, no ruts)=噴凝土（一袋）@n對岩面按右鍵，噴這一面 3×3 格（支護壓力 @1 MPa）@n重複噴可以加厚，最多 @2 層，壓力照層數累加@n對碎石按右鍵：表層 3×3 格直接壓實（不流動、沒有車轍）
Handheld XRF analyzer@nKeep it in your inventory: shows the grade of rock, rubble and material in truck beds=手持式 XRF 分析儀@n放在背包裡：看得到岩石、碎石、車斗裡的料的品位
GSI chart (Hoek & Marinos)@nKeep it in your inventory: shows lithology, GSI and overburden thickness=GSI 評估圖卡（Hoek & Marinos）@n放在背包裡：看得到岩性、GSI、上覆厚度
Loadout bin@n@1 m³ bin; the grate on top takes conveyor feed (or trucks and excavators dumping onto it); the loading boom loads trucks and haul trucks parked within @2 m@nSet an autonomous truck's loading point near the boom and it will wait there to be loaded@nRight-click on flat ground to build: 3×3 m, @3 m tall, boom facing you=裝車料斗@n@1 m³ 的料倉，頂上格柵接輸送帶（或卡車、怪手倒上去），放料臂裝 @2 m 內停著的卡車、礦卡@n無人卡車的裝載點設在放料臂附近就會在那裡等著裝@n對著平地按右鍵蓋：3×3 m、高 @3 m，放料臂朝自己這邊
Locker@nHolds small items, @1 slots; shared by the whole team, only your team and the teacher can open it@nDig it (empty it first) to get the work order back=置物箱@n放小東西，@1 格；全組共用，只有自己組和老師打得開@n拆掉（要先清空）變回施工單
Survey prism@nAttach to a rock face to record the rock displacement there (updated on nearby excavation and stress solves); right-click for the curve=監測稜鏡@n貼在岩面上，記錄那裡的岩石位移（附近開挖、算應力時更新）；右鍵看曲線
@1@nγ@=@2 kN/m³  UCS@=@3 MPa  σt@=@4 MPa@nOnce placed, shows the joints at its location=@1@nγ@=@2 kN/m³  UCS@=@3 MPa  σt@=@4 MPa@n放置後依所在位置顯示節理
Rubble@nBroken rock=碎石@n破碎的岩石
Granite rubble@nBroken granite=花崗岩碎石@n破碎的花崗岩
Loose soil@nLike rubble, it flows at its angle of repose and has weight; a full block left alone grows grass and turns back into topsoil=鬆土@n跟碎石一樣會照安息角流動、有重量；滿格放久了長草變回表土
Excavator operator@nHold and right-click an empty excavator: send him to work it@nRight-click the camp bench: let him rest=怪手操作員@n拿著對沒人的怪手按右鍵：派他上車作業@n對營地長椅按右鍵：交給他休息
Ore plant@nRight-click on flat ground to place: digs a @1×@2 m receiving hopper toward you, with a storage tower on each side of the machine@nSeparates feed into clean coal and rejects; trucks and haul trucks stopped within reach of a loading boom get loaded=選礦場@n對著平地按右鍵放置：朝自己的方向挖 @1×@2 m 受料倉，機身左右各一座儲料塔@n分選成精煤和矸石；卡車或礦卡停在放料臂範圍內裝料
Rubble wand@nLeft-click: clear 3×3×3 rubble in front of you@nRight-click: clear all connected rubble@nHold Shift: put the cleared rubble into your inventory=清碴魔杖@n左鍵：清除面前 3×3×3 碎石@n右鍵：清除相連的所有碎石@n按住 Shift：清掉的碎石收進物品欄
Blast wand@nLeft-click: detonate TNT (rock breaks according to its strength)@nRight-click: one-click mucking (nearby and connected rubble)@nShift + right-click: put the cleared rubble into your inventory=爆破魔杖@n左鍵：引爆 TNT（岩石依強度破碎）@n右鍵：一鍵清碴（附近與相連的碎石）@n按住 Shift 右鍵：清掉的碎石收進物品欄
Dig wand@nLeft-click: remove the 3×3×3 centered on the pointed block (rock, rubble, etc.)@nRight-click: one-click mucking (nearby and connected rubble)@nShift + right-click: put the cleared rubble into your inventory=挖洞魔杖@n左鍵：移除以指到的格為中心的 3×3×3（岩石、碎石等）@n右鍵：一鍵清碴（附近與相連的碎石）@n按住 Shift 右鍵：清掉的碎石收進物品欄
Geological compass@nRight-click a rock face: stress and factor of safety; sneak + right-click: full data@nLeft-click a rock face: measure joint orientation (stereonet); sneak + left-click: measure the slope; right-click the air: open the stereonet=地質羅盤@n右鍵岩面：應力與安全係數；蹲下＋右鍵：完整資料@n左鍵岩面：量節理位態（赤平投影）；蹲下＋左鍵：量坡面；對空中右鍵：打開赤平投影
Back to camp@nHold it and left-click or right-click to return to your team's camp=回營地@n拿在手上按左鍵或右鍵，回到自己組的營地
Schmidt hammer@nRight-click a rock face: one impact gives one rebound number R, recorded in your field notebook. Take about 10 readings at a spot; the median converts to uniaxial compressive strength (Katz 2000: UCS ≈ 2.21·e^(0.067R))=施密特錘@n對岩面右鍵：敲一下得到一個回彈值 R，記進野帳本。同一處敲 10 次左右，取中位數換算單軸抗壓強度（Katz 2000：UCS ≈ 2.21·e^(0.067R)）
Timber post (diameter @1 cm)@nRight-click a floor: it extends upward until it reaches the roof, up to @2 m@nReaching a rock roof → support: capacity P @= min(crushing, buckling), spread over the 3×3 m² of roof around the post top@n2 m about @3 kN, 4 m about @4 kN, 6 m about @5 kN (longer posts buckle more easily)@nRight-click a wall: placed horizontally as a beam=木柱（直徑 @1 cm）@n對地板按右鍵：往上長到碰到頂板，最長 @2 m@n頂到岩石頂板 → 支撐：承載力 P @= min(壓碎, 挫屈)，分給柱頂周圍 3×3 m² 的頂板@n2 m 約 @3 kN、4 m 約 @4 kN、6 m 約 @5 kN（柱越長越容易挫屈）@n對牆面按右鍵：橫放當樑
Timber plank (building material, not a support)@nThin board: placed on the ground it is a floor; placed against a ceiling it sits under the ceiling=木板（建材，不算支撐）@n薄木板：對地面放是地板，對頂面放貼在天花板下
Timber slab (building material, not a support)@nPlaced on a top face it is a lower half block; on a bottom face, an upper half block=木板半格（建材，不算支撐）@n對頂面放是下半格、對底面放是上半格
Geological compass@nRight-click a rock face: stress and factor of safety@nSneak + right-click: full data (lithology, initial stress, joints on all six faces)=地質羅盤@n右鍵岩面：應力與安全係數@n蹲下＋右鍵：完整資料（岩性、初始應力、六面節理）
Autonomous haulage kit@nHold it and right-click a dump truck or haul truck to install it (one module per vehicle); needed for autonomous driving=自動駕駛模組@n拿著對卡車或礦卡按右鍵安裝（一個模組裝一台），裝了才能用無人駕駛
Right-click to get in; Space loads the tank with ANFO and emulsion, E fills the downward holes within reach of the boom with ANFO + a primer=右鍵上車；空白鍵 儲槽裝 ANFO 與乳膠炸藥、E 把吊臂範圍內往下的鑽孔灌 ANFO＋起爆藥包
Right-click to push; Space tips the bed forward (capacity @1 blocks)@nRight-click while holding rubble to load it=右鍵推車；空白鍵把車斗往前倒（載量 @1 塊）@n手上拿著碎石時右鍵是裝上去
Right-click to get in; E drills a core hole downward below the mast (up to @1 m) and gives you core boxes and a borehole log=右鍵上車；E 在桅桿下方往下鑽岩芯孔（最深 @1 m），得到岩芯箱與鑽孔柱狀圖
Right-click to get in; E lowers/raises the blade; with the blade down, drive forward to push rubble away=右鍵上車；E 放鏟／收鏟，放鏟時往前開把碎石推走
Right-click to get in; E drills a vertical hole below the mast, Space sets the hole depth (surface bench blasting, the hole is filled with ANFO)=右鍵上車；E 在桅桿下方往下鑽一個垂直孔、空白鍵 設定孔深（露天台階爆破，孔裡倒 ANFO）
Hydraulic breaker kit (excavator attachment)@nHold it and right-click an excavator to install; with an empty bucket, Space switches bucket / breaker@nPoint the breaker at rock and press E to break it: the time is proportional to rock strength (UCS)=油壓破碎錘（怪手改裝套件）@n拿著對怪手按右鍵裝上；鏟斗空的時候空白鍵切換鏟斗／破碎錘@n破碎錘對著岩石按 E 敲碎：時間跟岩石強度（UCS）成正比
Radio@nClick an excavator to select it, then click the ground: send its operator there (left or right click)@nClick the one that is moving: stop it@nClick a truck or haul truck: open its autonomous haulage settings (start, stop, depart now)=對講機@n點怪手選定，再點地面：叫怪手的操作員開過去（左鍵、右鍵都可以）@n點正在移動的那台：叫它停下@n點卡車、礦卡：打開它的無人駕駛設定（啟動、停止、立即出發）
Right-click to get in; E digs where the cursor points (4 m³ bucket), Space dumps where the cursor points (point at a truck to load it)=右鍵上車；E 挖滑鼠指的位置（鏟斗 4 m³）、空白鍵倒在滑鼠指的位置（指著卡車就倒進卡車）
Right-click to get in; E digs where the cursor points (12 m³ bucket, arm about 15 m), Space dumps where the cursor points (point at a haul truck to load its bed)=右鍵上車；E 挖滑鼠指的位置（鏟斗 12 m³，手臂約 15 m）、空白鍵倒在滑鼠指的位置（指著礦卡就倒進車斗）
Right-click to get in; Space tips the bed out at the rear (capacity @1 m³)=右鍵上車；空白鍵把車斗倒在車尾（載量 @1 m³）
Right-click to get in; E drills the face ahead following the blast hole pattern, Space edits the pattern=右鍵上車；E 依爆破孔設計圖在前方工作面鑽孔、空白鍵 編輯設計圖
Right-click to get in; E charges the holes in the face ahead (relief holes are skipped), Space sets the sticks per hole=右鍵上車；E 把前方工作面的鑽孔裝藥（空孔跳過）、空白鍵 設定每孔幾條
Right-click to get in; E pulls a vehicle next to the deck onto it (own weight ≤ @1 t: excavators, dozers, drill rigs, trucks…, wrecked ones too); press E again to unload it at the rear=右鍵上車；E 把平板旁邊的車拉上平板（自重 ≤ @1 t：怪手、推土機、鑽機、卡車…，報廢的也行），再按 E 卸在車尾
Right-click to get in; E turns the drum on/off (drive forward with it on to cut rock directly, no blasting needed); Space sets the cut depth: 1 m down / level@nOn-board bin 60 m³, unloads automatically into a nearby truck, conveyor or crusher; autonomous trucks can bind to it=右鍵上車；E 滾筒開／關（開著往前開就把岩石直接切下來，不用爆破）、空白鍵 切深 下切 1 m／平切@n車上料倉 60 m³，自動卸到旁邊的卡車、輸送帶或破碎站；無人卡車可以綁定它
Right-click to get in (for getting around; four-wheel drive, climbs slopes up to 30°)=右鍵上車（代步用，四輪驅動，爬坡可到 30°）
Weather station (Stevenson screen)@nPoint at it to see the current rainfall rate and the total of this rain=氣象站（百葉箱）@n指著它看目前的時雨量、這場雨的累積雨量
Log@nCarry it to a saw bench to saw it into posts or planks=原木@n扛到鋸木台鋸成木柱或木板
Sapling@nPlant it on a full block of soil; it grows into a tree after a while=樹苗@n種在滿格的土上，過一陣子長成樹
Axe@nChop any block of a trunk and the whole tree falls into logs=斧頭@n砍樹幹任何一格，整棵樹倒下變成原木
Wooden wall panel (building material, not a support)@nA thin upright board for building walls=木牆板（建材，不算支撐）@n直立的薄板，做牆壁用
Topsoil@nSoil with grass and roots: the roots give it cohesion, so it stands even on steep slopes. If dug, undermined, or if an excavated face next to it is too high (above its critical standing height), it turns into loose soil and flows at its angle of repose=表土@n長著草和樹根的土：根系有凝聚力，陡坡上也站得住；被挖、底下被掏空、或旁邊挖開的陡壁太高（超過自立高度），就變成鬆土照安息角流
Core drill rig (60 m)=岩芯鑽探車（60 m）
Loadout bin (belt to truck)=裝車料斗（接輸送帶裝車）
Excavator operator (daily wage extra)=怪手操作員（雇用另付日薪）
Hydraulic breaker (excavator kit)=油壓破碎錘（怪手改裝套件）
Autonomous haulage kit (trucks)=自動駕駛模組（卡車、礦卡）
Axe (chop trees)=斧頭（砍樹）
Saw bench (logs to posts, planks)=鋸木台（原木鋸成木柱、木板）
Workbench (walls, stairs, doors…)=木工桌（木牆板、樓梯、門…）
Weather station (rainfall rate)=氣象站（百葉箱，時雨量）
Survey prism (rock displacement)=監測稜鏡（岩面位移）
Schmidt hammer (rebound → UCS)=施密特錘（岩面回彈值 → UCS）
Point load tester (core Is50 → UCS)=點荷重試驗機（岩芯 Is50 → UCS）
Timber post (support, building)=木柱（支撐、蓋房子）
Command drone (drone + radio)=指揮無人機（無人機＋對講機）
XRF analyzer (grade)=XRF 分析儀（品位）
GSI chart (rock mass)=GSI 評估圖卡（岩體）
Hand core drill (10 m)=手持岩芯鑽機（10 m）
Geological compass (mechanics)=地質羅盤（力學）
Field notebook (core logging)=野帳本（判讀岩芯箱）
Locker (small items)=置物箱（放小東西）
You can see the core, but not read it: learn "Rock mass classification" to see lithology, joints and RQD (and "Grade interpretation" for grade)=看得到岩芯，但看不懂：學會「岩體分類」才看得出岩性、節理、RQD（品位要「品位判讀」）
