What do you need? Trucks, excavators, crushers, all here.=要買什麼？卡車、怪手、破碎站都有。
Every machine burns diesel. Count the fuel bill.=機器都吃柴油，油錢要算進去。
Keep loaded trucks off steep ramps.=載重的卡車別開太陡的坡。
Stay well back from the face when you fire.=起爆的時候離工作面遠一點。
Fire the cut holes first, then the outer ring has a free face.=先炸中間的掏槽孔，外圈才有自由面。
Wait for the fumes to clear before you go back in.=炮煙散了再進去。
Bolts and shotcrete hold the face up.=岩栓、噴凝土可以撐住岩面。
Tap the rock with a Schmidt hammer first.=先用施密特錘敲敲看岩石有多硬。
Anything small, I've got it.=小東西都在我這裡。
Need supplies?=要補貨嗎？
Broken machine? I can fix it.=車壞了？我幫你修。
Worn vehicles run slow.=車子磨損了會跑得慢。
Joints decide how the rock fails.=岩體怎麼壞，看節理。
Read the cores before you dig.=挖之前先看岩芯。
Take me to the rock.=帶我去看岩石。
Dense joints here. Watch for falls.=這裡節理很密，小心落石。
Ready for an exam?=要考試嗎？
Rock mechanics is stress against strength.=岩石力學就是應力跟強度在比。
Tell me where to dig.=要挖哪裡跟我說。
Bucket's ready.=鏟斗準備好了。
Taking a break.=休息一下。
