Flat jack@nRight-click a rock wall to measure; E switches between a vertical slot (horizontal stress) and a horizontal slot (vertical stress)=平板千斤頂@n右鍵岩壁量測；E 切換垂直槽（量水平應力）／水平槽（量垂直應力）
