You let go of right-click; logging interrupted=放開右鍵了，判讀中斷
cj @1 MPa, φj @= atan(Jr/Ja): @2; @3=cj @1 MPa，φj @= atan(Jr/Ja)：@2；@3
Stereonet=赤平投影
Stereonet (lower hemisphere, equal-angle)=赤平投影（下半球、等角）
Drawing…=繪製中…
No joint readings yet (compass: right-click a rock face, then E)=還沒有節理紀錄（羅盤右鍵岩面，再按 E 記下來）
Circles: friction circle of each measured set, in its colour (φj @= atan(Jr/Ja))=圓圈：有量到的節理組的摩擦圓，顏色跟該組相同（φj @= atan(Jr/Ja)）
Markland: pole outside the circle, same side as the slope pole, flatter than the slope → may slide=Markland：極點在摩擦圓外、跟坡面極點同側、比坡面緩 → 可能滑動
Written into the field notebook (@1 joint readings; see the stereonet tab)=記進野帳本了（共 @1 筆節理；在「赤平投影」分頁看圖）
Discontinuous: the joint ends inside the rock=不連續：節理在岩石裡就斷了
Feels rough or irregular; the surface undulates=摸起來粗糙或不規則，面呈波狀起伏
Feels smooth; the surface undulates=摸起來平滑，面呈波狀起伏
Feels rough or irregular; the surface is planar=摸起來粗糙或不規則，面平直
Feels smooth; the surface is planar=摸起來平滑，面平直
Slickensided and polished; the surface is planar=有擦痕、光滑發亮，面平直
Tightly healed with a hard, non-softening filling (quartz, epidote)=緊密癒合，充填物堅硬不軟化（石英、綠簾石）
Fresh walls, only surface staining=壁面新鮮未蝕變，只有表面染色
Slightly altered walls: non-softening mineral coating, sandy grains=壁面輕微蝕變，有不軟化的礦物披覆或砂粒
Silty or sandy clay coating, a little non-softening clay=有粉質或砂質黏土披覆，少量不軟化黏土
Softening or low-friction clay coating (kaolinite, mica, chlorite, talc)=有軟化或低摩擦的黏土礦物披覆（高嶺石、雲母、綠泥石、滑石）
Filled with sand and crushed rock, no clay=充填砂粒和碎岩，不含黏土
Thin filling of stiff, non-softening clay=薄層的堅硬不軟化黏土充填
Thin filling of softening clay=薄層的軟化黏土充填
Thin filling of swelling clay=薄層的膨脹性黏土充填
Thick band of stiff clay=厚層的堅硬黏土帶
Thick band of softening clay=厚層的軟化黏土帶
Thick band of swelling clay=厚層的膨脹性黏土帶
Jr @1  Ja @2 → φj ≈ @3°=Jr @1  Ja @2 → φj ≈ @3°
φj ≈ @1°=φj ≈ @1°
